}]},"num":8,"verses":[{"en":"And now it came to pass that according to our record, and we know our record to be true, for behold, it was a just man who did keep the record—for he truly did many miracles in the name of Jesus; and there was not any man who could do a miracle in the name of Jesus save he were cleansed every whit from his iniquity—","n":1,"sm":"Ma lenei sa oo ina tusa ma la matou talafaamaumau, ma ua matou iloa ua moni la matou talafaamaumau, aua faauta, o se tagata amiotonu na tausia le talafaamaumau— ona sa ia faia moni lava vavega e tele i le suafa o Iesu; ma sa leai se tagata sa mafai ona ia faia o se vavega i le suafa o Iesu vagana ai ua faamamaina o ia mai i mea uma mai lana amioletonu—","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"And now","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"it came to pass","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"according to","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"la"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"our record,","sm":"talafaamaumau,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"and we know","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"is true","sm":"moni"},{"en":"·","sm":"la"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"our record,","sm":"talafaamaumau,"},{"en":"·","sm":"aua"},{"en":"for behold,","sm":"faauta,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"it was a righteous man","sm":"amiotonu"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"tausia"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"who kept the record—","sm":"talafaamaumau—"},{"en":"for","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"faia"},{"en":"·","sm":"moni"},{"en":"he truly did","sm":"lava"},{"en":"·","sm":"vavega"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"many miracles","sm":"tele"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"suafa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"in the name of Jesus;","sm":"Iesu;"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"leai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"and there was no man","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"mafai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ia"},{"en":"who could do","sm":"faia"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"a miracle","sm":"vavega"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"suafa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"in the name of Jesus","sm":"Iesu"},{"en":"·","sm":"vagana"},{"en":"except","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"faamamaina"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"he was cleansed","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"mea"},{"en":"in all things","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"lana"},{"en":"from his iniquity—","sm":"amioletonu—"}]},{"en":"And now it came to pass, if there was no mistake made by this man in the reckoning of our time, the thirty and third year had passed away;","n":2,"sm":"Ma o lenei sa oo ina afai e leai se sese na faia e lenei tagata i le faitauina o lo matou taimi, ua mavae atu nei le tolusefulu ma le tolu o tausaga;","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"And now","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"oo"},{"en":"it came to pass","sm":"ina"},{"en":"·","sm":"afai"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"leai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"if there was no error","sm":"sese"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"faia"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"lenei"},{"en":"made by this man","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"faitauina"},{"en":"in the reckoning of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"our time,","sm":"taimi,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"·","sm":"atu"},{"en":"there has now passed away","sm":"nei"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"tolusefulu"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"thirty-three","sm":"tolu"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"years;","sm":"tausaga;"}]},{"en":"And the people began to look with great earnestness for the sign which had been given by the prophet Samuel, the Lam