n":"·","sm":"mauga"},{"en":"a great mountain.","sm":"tele."}]},{"en":"And there was a great and terrible destruction in the land southward.","n":11,"sm":"Ma sa i ai se faafanoga tele i le laueleele i saute.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"And there was","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"faafanoga"},{"en":"a great destruction","sm":"tele"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"in the land southward.","sm":"saute."}]},{"en":"But behold, there was a more great and terrible destruction in the land northward; for behold, the whole face of the land was changed, because of the tempest and the whirlwinds and the thunderings and the lightnings, and the exceedingly great quaking of the whole earth;","n":12,"sm":"Ae faauta, sa i ai se faafanoga tele ma matautia sili atu i le laueleele i matu; aua faauta, sa suia foliga o le laueleele atoa, ona o le matagi ma asiosio, ma faititili ma uila, ma le luluina tele naua o le laueleele atoa;","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ae"},{"en":"But behold,","sm":"faauta,"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"there was","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"faafanoga"},{"en":"·","sm":"tele"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"matautia"},{"en":"·","sm":"sili"},{"en":"a greater and more terrible destruction","sm":"atu"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"in the land northward;","sm":"matu;"},{"en":"·","sm":"aua"},{"en":"for behold,","sm":"faauta,"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"suia"},{"en":"·","sm":"foliga"},{"en":"the face was changed of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"laueleele"},{"en":"the whole land,","sm":"atoa,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"because of","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"matagi"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"the wind and whirlwinds,","sm":"asiosio,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"faititili"},{"en":